# ── Sensitive files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All sender state (sent log, failed log, bounce cursor, opens backup) lives
# inside turso-full.db now — *.db covers it, no separate log files needed.
*.db
# ...except the sender's database, now tracked deliberately so a clone carries
# the live queue and send history instead of rebuilding from CSV. Private repo
# only — it holds contact details and per-recipient open data. Caveat: it is a
# binary git cannot merge, so if two checkouts both push it one silently
# overwrites the other's send history. Pull before every send, and never send
# from two machines at once.
!sender/turso-full.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.env
venv/
bounce_scan.log

# ── PDFs (personal) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pdf

# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.xlsx
